      }
    ]
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "cassim-bell.bond.node.direction.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "background",
        "assetId": "cassim-bell.bond.asset.background.001",
        "transition": "dissolve"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.bond.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.bond.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "雨の休日。カシムさんが「見せたい場所があります」と言った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.bond.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.bond.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "保管庫の奥へ、ついて行った。第七十七棚区画、通称は持ち主不明の谷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.bond.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.bond.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "そこは、七世界の落とし物の山だった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.bond.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.bond.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "巨大竜の長靴、海底王の冠、小国騎士の盾、月の傘が三本。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.bond.node.line.002c",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.bond.line.002c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "全部、百年以上も持ち主が現れない品々らしい。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.bond.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.bond.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1wuvexi",
      "speakerName": "カシム・ベル",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "規則では、ここは立入禁止です。ただし——受付係が同伴する茶会は、規則に書かれていません。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.bond.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.bond.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "カシムさんが規則の隙間を使うの、初めて見ました。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.bond.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.bond.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1wuvexi",
      "speakerName": "カシム・ベル",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "求人票第二条。「休憩は業務」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.bond.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.bond.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1wuvexi",
      "speakerName": "カシム・ベル",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……業務は、真面目にやる主義です。"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "cassim-bell.bond.node.direction.003",
      "command": {
        "type": "still",
        "assetId": "cassim-bell.bond.asset.still.001"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.bond.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.bond.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "屁理屈の使い方が、いい方向に壊れてきた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.bond.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.bond.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "巨大竜の長靴(毛布つき)を椅子に、月の傘を屋根にした。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.bond.node.line.006c",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.bond.line.006c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "雨音の中でお茶会を始めた。世界で一番ぜいたくな雨宿りだと思う。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "cassim-bell.bond.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "effect",
        "effectId": "pulse"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.bond.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.bond.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "カシムさんの淹れる紅茶は、受付仕込みの正確さだった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.bond.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.bond.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "砂時計で蒸らし時間を計り、黒手袋で注ぎ、取っ手を必ずこちらへ向けて出す。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.bond.node.line.007c",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.bond.line.007c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "所作の一つずつが、七十二時間働く手と同じとは思えないほど静かだ。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.bond.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.bond.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……接客中じゃないあなたの顔、初めて見た気がします。"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "cassim-bell.bond.node.direction.004",
      "command": {
        "type": "still",
        "assetId": "cassim-bell.bond.asset.still.002"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.bond.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.bond.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1wuvexi",
      "speakerName": "カシム・ベル",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……お互い様です。あなたも今、兎耳が、完全に休んでいる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.bond.node.line.010a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.bond.line.010a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "言われて気づいた。接客中の私の耳は、いつも音を拾って立ってる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.bond.node.line.010b",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.bond.line.010b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "今は、雨音の方へ、くたっと倒れていた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.bond.node.line.010c",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.bond.line.010c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "接客者同士にしか見えない休みの形が、お互いの頭の上にあった。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.bond.node.line.011a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.bond.line.011a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1wuvexi",
      "speakerName": "カシム・ベル",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "この谷の品は、私が受付した子たちです。持ち主は、もう現れないかもしれない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.bond.node.line.011b",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.bond.line.011b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1wuvexi",
      "speakerName": "カシム・ベル",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "それでも、埃を払って、雨漏りから守って——待つのが、私の仕事でした。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.bond.node.line.012a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.bond.line.012a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "七世界の落とし物の谷は、つまり、この人が誰にも頼まれずに守ってきた待合室。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.bond.node.line.012b",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.bond.line.012b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "終わった物語の、持ち物たちの。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "cassim-bell.bond.node.line.013a",
      "lineId": "cassim-bell.bond.line.013a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "お茶のおかわりの前に、午後の過ごし方を決めることにした。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "id": "cassim-bell.bond.node.choice.001",
      "choices": [
